DATASET USAGE TERMS:

While this code is MIT licensed, users of the dataset must comply with:

1. YouTube Terms of Service (https://www.youtube.com/t/terms)
2. Applicable data protection regulations (GDPR, CCPA, etc.)
3. Ethical research guidelines
4. Privacy considerations for user-generated content

The dataset contains publicly available YouTube comments. Users must:
- Not attempt to de-anonymize users
- Use data responsibly and ethically
- Provide appropriate content warnings for toxic content
- Cite this work when using the dataset
